{% comment %}
=====================================================================
 02 · Double Opt-In · snippets.liquid
 Canvas A: CANVAS | Double Opt-In Request | v1
 Canvas B: CANVAS | Double Opt-In Confirm | v1
 Brand:    Northwind Supply Co. (fictional)

 Rules for this program
 - Confirmation emails contain no promotional content. One button.
 - The Confirm link must carry link alias `confirm-subscription`
   (set in the email editor's Link Management tab, per message).
 - Entry properties: {{canvas_entry_properties.${name}}}.
=====================================================================
{% endcomment %}


{% comment %} ==================== BEGIN EM_DOI_S1 ====================
 Canvas A · Step 1 · T+0 · Email · confirmation request
 Subject:   Confirm your Northwind subscription
 Preheader: One click and you're in. This link expires in 7 days.
 Confirm link alias: confirm-subscription
{% endcomment %}
{%- assign source = canvas_entry_properties.${signup_source} | default: 'general' | downcase -%}
{{content_blocks.${CB_GLOBAL_HEADER_MINIMAL}}}
<h1>One click to confirm.</h1>
{%- if source == 'checkout' -%}
<p>You asked for Northwind emails when you checked out. Confirm below and we'll start sending.</p>
{%- else -%}
<p>You (or someone using this address) asked to join the Northwind Supply Co. email list. Confirm below and we'll start sending.</p>
{%- endif %}
<p><a href="https://www.example.com/subscribe/confirmed?src={{source | url_encode}}&amp;utm_source=braze&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=EM_DOI_S1" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;background:#1f3a5f;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;">Confirm my subscription</a></p>
<p>What you'll get: gear guides, restock alerts, and member sales, about once a week.</p>
<p>Didn't sign up? Ignore this email. You won't hear from us again unless you confirm.</p>
{{content_blocks.${CB_GLOBAL_FOOTER_MINIMAL}}}
{% comment %} ===================== END EM_DOI_S1 ===================== {% endcomment %}


{% comment %} ==================== BEGIN EM_DOI_S2 ====================
 Canvas A · Step 2 · T+48h · Email · reminder (90% path; 10% control gets nothing)
 Subject:   Still want Northwind emails?
 Preheader: Your confirmation link expires in 5 days.
 Confirm link alias: confirm-subscription (set it again on this message)
 Aborts if the user confirmed between the split and the send.
{% endcomment %}
{%- if custom_attribute.${doi_status} == 'confirmed' -%}
  {% abort_message('EM_DOI_S2: already confirmed') %}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign source = canvas_entry_properties.${signup_source} | default: 'general' | downcase -%}
{{content_blocks.${CB_GLOBAL_HEADER_MINIMAL}}}
<h1>Still want in?</h1>
<p>Two days ago you asked to join the Northwind list, but we haven't heard back. If you still want gear guides and restock alerts, confirm below. The link expires in 5 days.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.example.com/subscribe/confirmed?src={{source | url_encode}}&amp;utm_source=braze&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=EM_DOI_S2" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;background:#1f3a5f;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;">Yes, confirm my subscription</a></p>
<p>Changed your mind? Do nothing. This is the last reminder.</p>
{{content_blocks.${CB_GLOBAL_FOOTER_MINIMAL}}}
{% comment %} ===================== END EM_DOI_S2 ===================== {% endcomment %}


{% comment %} ============ BEGIN FRAGMENT_DOI_CONFIRM_LINK ============
 Fragment (not sent alone). Hardened variant only. Replace the Confirm
 link href in EM_DOI_S1
 and EM_DOI_S2 with this. The page shows a Confirm button that fires
 `email_confirm_clicked`, so link scanners cannot confirm the address.
 `doi_token` is a random, single-use token your backend writes to the
 profile at signup. Aborts if it is missing: a confirm page without a
 token cannot record consent.
{% endcomment %}
{%- assign doi_token = custom_attribute.${doi_token} | strip -%}
{%- if doi_token == blank -%}
  {% abort_message('DOI hardened: doi_token missing') %}
{%- endif -%}
https://www.example.com/subscribe/confirm?t={{doi_token | url_encode}}&amp;utm_source=braze&amp;utm_medium=email
{% comment %} ============= END FRAGMENT_DOI_CONFIRM_LINK ============= {% endcomment %}


{% comment %} ================= BEGIN UPD_DOI_EXPIRE ==================
 Canvas A · Step 3 · T+7d · User Update · Advanced JSON
 Paste the JSON line only. Add "email_subscribe": "unsubscribed" to
 the object if your policy unsubscribes expired addresses.
{% endcomment %}
{"attributes": [{"doi_status": "expired"}]}
{% comment %} ================== END UPD_DOI_EXPIRE =================== {% endcomment %}


{% comment %} ================= BEGIN UPD_DOI_CONFIRM =================
 Canvas B · Step 1 · On click · User Update · Advanced JSON
 Required core: {"attributes": [{"email_subscribe": "opted_in"}]}
 The full payload below also stamps status and time, and logs
 `email_confirmed`, which exits Canvas A and enters program 01.
 Paste the JSON only.
{% endcomment %}
{"attributes": [{"email_subscribe": "opted_in", "doi_status": "confirmed", "doi_confirmed_at": "{{ 'now' | date: '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ' }}"}], "events": [{"name": "email_confirmed", "time": "{{ 'now' | date: '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ' }}"}]}
{% comment %} ================== END UPD_DOI_CONFIRM ================== {% endcomment %}
